---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { Shield, Lock, Eye, FileText, Server, UserCheck, HelpCircle } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy - AI NoteBook"
	description="Read the official Privacy Policy for AI NoteBook. Discover how we protect your personal information, notes, and study material uploads with end-to-end security."
	keywords="AI NoteBook privacy policy, online note security, study material privacy, data protection"
	canonicalURL="https://notebook.app/privacy"
>
	<Header currentPath="/privacy" />

	<main class="relative min-h-screen bg-canvas-soft">
		<!-- Mesh Gradient Background -->
		<div class="mesh-gradient-container opacity-20"></div>

		<!-- Page Header -->
		<section class="relative max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-12 z-10">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-canvas border border-hairline text-ink text-[11px] font-mono rounded-full mb-4 shadow-level-1">
				<Shield size={12} className="text-link" />
				<span>LEGAL & COMPLIANCE</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mb-4">
				Privacy Policy.
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-body max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
				At AI NoteBook, we respect your data and privacy above all else. This policy describes what information we collect, how we handle it, and the security measures protecting your notes.
			</p>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-mute font-mono border-t border-hairline pt-4">
				<span>Last Updated: July 23, 2026</span>
				<span>•</span>
				<span>Version 1.2</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Grid -->
		<section class="relative max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-6 pb-24 z-10">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
				
				<!-- Quick Jump Sidebar -->
				<aside class="hidden md:block col-span-1 space-y-2 sticky top-24 h-fit text-xs select-none">
					<span class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] text-mute font-semibold block mb-3">On this page</span>
					<a href="#overview" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">1. Overview</a>
					<a href="#information-collected" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">2. Information We Collect</a>
					<a href="#data-usage" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">3. How We Use Data</a>
					<a href="#security" id="security" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">4. Security & Encryption</a>
					<a href="#cookies" id="cookies" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">5. Cookies & Storage</a>
					<a href="#third-parties" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">6. Third-Party Services</a>
					<a href="#your-rights" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">7. Your Rights</a>
					<a href="#contact-privacy" class="block text-body hover:text-ink transition-colors py-1">8. Contact Us</a>
				</aside>

				<!-- Main Legal Text -->
				<article class="col-span-1 md:col-span-3 space-y-12 text-body text-sm leading-relaxed">
					
					<!-- 1. Overview -->
					<div id="overview" class="bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-level-1 space-y-4">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-ink">
							<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline flex items-center justify-center">
								<Eye size={18} className="text-link" />
							</div>
							<h2 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">1. Overview & Commitment</h2>
						</div>
						<p>
							AI NoteBook ("we", "our", or "us") provides digital note-taking, study material management, and AI-assisted workflow software. This Privacy Policy governs all users of notebook.app and associated API services.
						</p>
						<p>
							Our core philosophy is simple: <strong>your academic notes, documents, and todo items remain strictly private and belong to you.</strong> We do not sell your personal data to advertisers or third-party brokers.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- 2. Information We Collect -->
					<div id="information-collected" class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<FileText size={20} className="text-ink" />
							2. Information We Collect
						</h2>
						<p>We collect information only when necessary to provide our digital notebook features:</p>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
							<li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Email address, encrypted authentication credentials, and user preferences when you register.</li>
							<li><strong>User Content:</strong> Markdown notes, todo checklists, subject categories, and study materials (such as uploaded PDFs and documents).</li>
							<li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Browser type, operating system version, device IP address, and interaction logs for error reporting and performance monitoring.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- 3. How We Use Data -->
					<div id="data-usage" class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<Server size={20} className="text-ink" />
							3. How We Use Your Data
						</h2>
						<p>Collected data is used solely for the following legitimate business purposes:</p>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4">
							<div class="p-4 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg">
								<h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-xs mb-1 font-mono">Service Delivery</h3>
								<p class="text-xs text-mute">Synchronizing notes across devices, rendering markdown, and indexing content for fast search.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="p-4 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-lg">
								<h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-xs mb-1 font-mono">AI Processing</h3>
								<p class="text-xs text-mute">Generating instant note summaries, subject tagging, and answering queries via our AI Assistant.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 4. Security & Encryption -->
					<div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<Lock size={20} className="text-link" />
							4. Security & Encryption Standard
						</h2>
						<p>
							All data in transit is protected using TLS 1.3 encryption protocols. Data stored at rest in database volumes is encrypted using AES-256 standards. Row-level security (RLS) policies enforce isolated user access, ensuring no unauthorized account can query your private study materials.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- 5. Cookies & Local Storage -->
					<div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">
							5. Cookies & Local Storage
						</h2>
						<p>
							We utilize local storage and essential session cookies strictly for authentication and theme preferences (`dark`/`light`). We do not deploy third-party tracking cookies or cross-site telemetry trackers.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- 6. Third-Party Services -->
					<div id="third-parties" class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">
							6. Third-Party Service Providers
						</h2>
						<p>We work with trusted infrastructure partners who comply with strict data safety regulations:</p>
						<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-xs">
							<li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Database hosting, user authentication, and secure storage bucket management.</li>
							<li><strong>Vercel / Cloudflare:</strong> Edge network hosting and static asset delivery.</li>
							<li><strong>Google Gemini API:</strong> Large language model inference for optional AI note summaries.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- 7. Your Rights -->
					<div id="your-rights" class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<UserCheck size={20} className="text-ink" />
							7. Your Rights & Choices
						</h2>
						<p>Regardless of your jurisdiction, you retain complete rights over your personal data:</p>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
							<div class="p-3 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-md text-center">
								<span class="font-semibold text-ink block mb-1">Export Data</span>
								<span class="text-mute">Download all notes in standard markdown format anytime.</span>
							</div>
							<div class="p-3 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-md text-center">
								<span class="font-semibold text-ink block mb-1">Modify Content</span>
								<span class="text-mute">Edit or clear any uploaded study files directly in your dashboard.</span>
							</div>
							<div class="p-3 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-md text-center">
								<span class="font-semibold text-ink block mb-1">Account Deletion</span>
								<span class="text-mute">Permanently purge your account and database records with 1 click.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 8. Contact Us -->
					<div id="contact-privacy" class="bg-canvas-soft-2 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
						<h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<HelpCircle size={18} className="text-link" />
							8. Contact Privacy Team
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
							If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to submit a data request, please contact our Compliance Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@notebook.app" class="text-link underline hover:text-link-deep font-mono">privacy@notebook.app</a> or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-link underline hover:text-link-deep font-semibold">Contact Page</a>.
						</p>
					</div>

				</article>

			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>
